ă</span></p><p begin="0:46.976" end="0:53.388" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.976" end="0:47.612">Pe</span> <span begin="0:47.612" end="0:48.249">toți</span> <span begin="0:48.249" end="0:48.885">la</span> <span begin="0:48.885" end="0:53.388">Dumnezeu!</span></p><p begin="0:53.388" end="0:58.379" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.388" end="0:55.260">Viața</span> <span begin="0:55.260" end="0:55.883">e-o</span> <span begin="0:55.883" end="0:58.379">plăcere,</span></p><p begin="0:58.379" end="1:03.369" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.379" end="0:59.002">Dar</span> <span begin="0:59.002" end="1:00.250">oare</span> <span begin="1:00.250" end="1:00.874">ce</span> <span begin="1:00.874" end="1:03.369">folos</span></p><p begin="1:03.369" end="1:08.359" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.369" end="1:03.993">Când</span> <span begin="1:03.993" end="1:05.240">iată</span> <span begin="1:05.240" end="1:06.488">lumea</span> <span begin="1:06.488" end="1:08.359">piere,</span></p><p begin="1:08.359" end="1:13.350" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.359" end="1:10.231">Departe</span> <span begin="1:10.231" end="1:10.855">de</span> <span begin="1:10.855" end="1:13.350">Hristos?</span></p><p begin="1:13.350" end="1:18.340" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.350" end="1:15.221">Lumina</span> <span begin="1:15.221" end="1:15.845">să</span> <span begin="1:15.845" end="1:18.340">răsară,</span></p><p begin="1:18.340" end="1:23.331" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.340" end="1:19.588">Lucrați</span> <span begin="1:19.588" end="1:20.524">cu</span> <span begin="1:20.524" end="1:23.331">Dumnezeu,</span></p><p begin="1:23.331" end="1:28.321" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.331" end="1:25.202">Niciunul</span> <span begin="1:25.202" end="1:25.826">să</span> <span begin="1:25.826" end="1:26.450">nu</span> <span begin="1:26.450" end="1:28.321">piară</span></p><p begin="1:28.321" end="1:34.852" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.321" end="1:28.945">În</span> <span begin="1:28.945" end="1:31.440">întuner